---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Topbar from '../components/Topbar.astro';
import FileTransferArticles from '../components/FileTransferArticles.astro';

const pageDescription =
	'Contact Rajesh Sarkar for questions about Onlne File Share, upload issues, download lookup, or access keys.';
---

<Layout
	title="Contact Onlne File Share - Upload and File Transfer Help"
	description={pageDescription}
	keywords="contact file sharing support, file upload help, file transfer help, access key help"
>
	<main class="page-shell">
		<Topbar active="contact" />

		<section class="contact-page">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Contact us</p>
				<h1>Need help with Onlne File Share?</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">For questions, feedback, or support, contact Rajesh Sarkar using the details below.</p>
			</div>
			<section class="contact-card" aria-label="Contact details">
				<div class="photo-shell">
					<img class="contact-photo" src="/WhatsApp%20Image%202026-05-31%20at%204.54.27%20PM(1).jpeg" alt="Rajesh Sarkar" loading="eager" />
				</div>
				<div><span>Name</span><strong>Rajesh Sarkar</strong></div>
				<div><span>Email</span><a href="mailto:rajeshsarkar736146@gmail.com">rajeshsarkar736146@gmail.com</a></div>
				<div><span>Phone</span><a href="tel:+918927544778">8927544778</a></div>
			</section>
		</section>

		<section class="contact-copy" aria-labelledby="contact-seo-title">
			<p class="eyebrow">Support</p>
			<h2 id="contact-seo-title">Something not working?</h2>
			<p>
				Use the contact details here for upload issues, download lookup questions, feedback, or
				ideas that would make the file sharing flow easier to use.
			</p>
			<p>
				The contact page is here because file sharing problems are often small but annoying. A file
				may fail to upload, a key may not open the expected download, a QR code may be hard to scan,
				or a mobile browser may behave differently from a desktop browser. If something like that
				happens, the details on this page are the best place to start.
			</p>
			<p>
				When you ask for help, include the page you were using, what you expected to happen, and
				what actually happened. For upload problems, it helps to mention the file type and rough
				size. For retrieve problems, mention whether you used a short key, a full link, or a QR
				code. Do not send private access keys in public places. If a key is sensitive, describe the
				problem first and wait before sharing anything private.
			</p>
			<p>
				Onlne File Share is meant for simple online file sharing and online file transfer. That
				means the site should be easy to use even when someone arrives from a quick search such as
				online file drop, file transfer link, online fileshare, onlne file shaing, or online file
				frop. If a label, button, upload step, or download message feels confusing, that feedback
				is useful. Small wording changes can make the page much clearer for the next person.
			</p>
			<p>
				You can also use this page for suggestions. Maybe the upload card should explain a file
				limit more clearly. Maybe the retrieve page needs a better error message. Maybe mobile
				layout needs more room in one area. The site has already been tuned around practical use:
				uploading a file, copying a key, scanning a QR code, and downloading from another device.
				Good feedback helps keep that flow simple instead of turning it into a crowded storage app.
			</p>
			<p>
				For business, school, creator, or personal use, the best file transfer tool is the one that
				does not get in the way. If something does get in the way, please share the details. The
				goal is not to add every feature possible. The goal is to make the common jobs reliable:
				send a file, share a key, retrieve the file, and move on.
			</p>
			<p>
				If your question is about privacy, check the privacy page too. If your question is about
				what should or should not be uploaded, read the terms page. For everything else, use the
				contact information above and describe the issue as plainly as you can.
			</p>
		</section>

		<FileTransferArticles />
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.contact-page { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(320px, 480px); gap: 36px; align-items: center; width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 0; }
	h1 { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 76px); line-height: 1; color: var(--ink); }
	.subtitle { max-width: 540px; color: var(--body); font-size: 18px; line-height: 29px; }
	.contact-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: var(--shadow); overflow: hidden; }
	.photo-shell { padding: 18px 18px 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent-dim), transparent); }
	.contact-photo { display: block; width: min(260px, 78%); aspect-ratio: 1; margin: 0 auto 18px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 28%; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; filter: saturate(.88) contrast(1.04); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
	.contact-card div { padding: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.contact-card div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
	.contact-card span, .contact-card strong, .contact-card a { display: block; }
	.contact-card span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.contact-card strong, .contact-card a { margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.contact-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: min(900px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: -28px auto 48px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 28px; }
	.contact-copy h2 { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px); line-height: 1.1; color: var(--ink); }
	.contact-copy p { color: var(--body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 27px; }
	.contact-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
	@media (max-width: 760px) { .contact-page { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
